---
layout: base.njk
title: Insights — Admizz Group
description: Ideas for what's next — perspectives from across Admizz Education, Admizz Institute and Admizz Workforce Solutions.
permalink: /insights/
---

{# ============================================================================
   /insights/ — rebuilt 2026-08-27 as a numbered editorial index.

   The old page split 3 posts into "1 big featured + 2 small" purely because
   one entry happens to carry featured:true — an arbitrary hierarchy for a
   set this small. Rebuilt as a single list of peers: a real reading time
   (the `readingTime` filter already existed in .eleventy.js, unused on this
   page until now) and the featured flag becomes a small honest tag instead
   of a size tier. No fake pagination, no "load more" — three posts is three
   posts.
   ============================================================================ #}

<section class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="mb-14 fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display font-light text-display-2 text-ink max-w-[16ch] text-balance">Ideas for what&rsquo;s next.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-body-lg text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight leading-relaxed">
        Perspectives from across Admizz Education, Admizz Institute and Admizz Workforce Solutions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="insights-index">
      {% for post in insights %}
      <article class="insights-row fade-up" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}ms">
        <span class="insights-row-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" }}{{ loop.index }}</span>

        <div class="insights-row-body">
          <div class="insights-row-meta">
            <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-soft">{{ post.venture }}</span>
            {% if post.featured %}
            <span class="insights-row-flag" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-text">Featured</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h2 class="insights-row-title">
            <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="hover:text-navy-soft transition-colors duration-press ease-signature">{{ post.title }}</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="insights-row-deck">{{ post.deck }}</p>
          <div class="insights-row-foot">
            <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">Read the piece</a>
            <span class="insights-row-time">{{ post.body | readingTime }} min read</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="insights-row-photo" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
          {% image "src/assets/images/insights/" + post.image, post.imageAlt, "(min-width: 700px) 13rem, 92vw" %}
        </a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# A quiet close, not another CTA band — three of the site's other rebuilt
   pages already end on an eyebrow/statement/button close; this one ends
   like a magazine section does, then points onward. #}
<section class="bg-paper-sunk border-t border-rule py-section-sm">
  <div class="shell text-center fade-up">
    <p class="font-display font-light italic text-h3 text-ink-muted">That&rsquo;s everything, for now.</p>
    <a href="/ventures/" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">
      More from the group
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
